      "text": "Don Thousand!"
    },
    {
      "char": "donthousand",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Few mortals have ever gained entry. You should consider this a great honor."
    },
    {
      "char": "vector",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "I do. In fact, I'm not even sure I'm worthy to be here."
    },
    {
      "char": "vector",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Hey, is that what I think it is?"
    },
    {
      "char": "vector",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Number 96?"
    },
    {
      "char": "donthousand",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "win",
      "text": "Correct. Astral was unable to destroy all his power."
    },
    {
      "char": "donthousand",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "So naturally, what was left returned to its rightful owner."
    },
    {
      "char": "vector",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Are you implying that that's you? How could that be?"
    },
    {
      "char": "donthousand",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Because Number 96 was originally a part of me."
    },
    {
      "char": "donthousand",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "When I battled with Astral, I attacked with such fury that a splinter of my dark power buried itself within his heart."
    },
    {
      "char": "vector",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Of course! I wondered how someone like Astral could have such a vile being inside of him."
    }
